.TH "GMB" "1" "Sep 2026" "GlassMarble 1.2.0" "GlassMarble Manual"

.SH NAME
gmb-doc-ledger - Show the structured run ledger (tokens, tracks, repairs, freshness)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgmb doc ledger [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the D5 observability rollup over recent doc-engine runs:
total tokens, per-track render counts, repairs, fallbacks, and freshness.
The ledger is append-only JSONL under .glassmarble/runs/.

.PP
With --alerts, the rollup is evaluated against alert thresholds
(--max-tokens, --min-freshness, --max-fallbacks; 0 disables that dimension)
via ledger.CheckAlerts and every breach is printed.

.PP
Exit codes:
  0  Rollup printed and (with --alerts) no alert fired
  1  One or more alerts fired (--alerts only)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--alerts\fP[=false]
	Evaluate alert thresholds over the rollup (exit 1 if any fires)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for ledger

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Emit machine-readable JSON output

.PP
\fB--last\fP=0
	Roll up only the last N runs (0 = all)

.PP
\fB--max-fallbacks\fP=0
	Alert when total fallbacks exceed this (0 = disabled)

.PP
\fB--max-tokens\fP=0
	Alert when total tokens exceed this budget (0 = disabled)

.PP
\fB--min-freshness\fP=0
	Alert when average freshness drops below this (0 = disabled)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--color\fP="auto"
	Color output mode: auto|always|never

.PP
\fB-c\fP, \fB--config\fP=""
	Config file path (default is $HOME/.glassmarble.yaml)

.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--dir\fP=""
	Target repository directory for analysis and queries

.PP
\fB--max-json-mb\fP=0
	Refuse to load or commit an AKG state file (akg.json) larger than this many MiB (0 = unlimited)

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-error output

.PP
\fB-v\fP, \fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	Verbose output logging


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gmb doc ledger
  gmb doc ledger --last 20 --json
  gmb doc ledger --alerts --max-tokens 50000 --min-freshness 70 --max-fallbacks 10
.EE


